WEBVTT

1
00:00:00,000 --> 00:00:00,960
Speaking of which

2
00:00:00,960 --> 00:00:02,560
Can I enter this lovelorn place?

3
00:00:02,560 --> 00:00:04,160
Thanks to you, Master Chu, for coming

4
00:00:04,160 --> 00:00:05,720
If I hadn't won that gold coin

5
00:00:05,720 --> 00:00:07,760
I really can't afford to spend the money that goes into a broken relationship.

6
00:00:07,760 --> 00:00:09,440
Just these three lovelorn scenes

7
00:00:09,440 --> 00:00:11,760
If you go in and catch a field, it will cost you one gold coin.

8
00:00:11,760 --> 00:00:13,320
Usually those are the ones

9
00:00:13,320 --> 00:00:14,760
An inner disciple with family affairs

10
00:00:14,760 --> 00:00:17,080
Only then are you willing to take money to enter the lovelorn field, Cao Lian comes

11
00:00:17,080 --> 00:00:18,040
Chu Brothers

12
00:00:18,040 --> 00:00:20,460
This order comes in a flash

13
00:00:20,460 --> 00:00:24,100
The snow hall was built at the head of the purple bamboo forest halfway up the mountain.

14
00:00:24,100 --> 00:00:43,650
This bamboo wind is really a shackles for cultivation

15
00:00:43,650 --> 00:00:46,260
I don’t know that the sects are united and only serve as patrons

16
00:00:46,260 --> 00:00:48,340
What a waste
